@startuml
' UC15.2 - Thêm Lesson
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx, UC15.2 row (create a Lesson in a Module).
' BR: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx, BR-79/80/88/284/285/147.
' These DOCX files are under docs/uml/docs, not directly under docs.
' Both metadata revisions are 1, without an identified business-spec release.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent; architecture prose is not proof of runtime calls.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.lesson.add.tsx:12/:25/:43.
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:457/:469 (modules/:moduleId/lessons/new).
' Wrapper: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:69 (createCourseLessonAPI).
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47/:61/:64; course.service.ts:1.
' URL selection: frontend/src/config/env.ts:13; frontend/.env.development:10.
' Local development Course base URL is http://localhost:8080; no local override file found.
' Relevant process VITE_* variables are unset; other launch/build modes are unverified.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:40-43.
' Trusted context: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/java/com/learnup/gateway/filter/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java:133.
' Prefix/version: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40-43 (api, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:89 (createLesson).
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:311 (createLesson).
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:148/:194/:205.
' DTO: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/dto/create-course-lesson.dto.ts:3.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:67/:84/:104.
' DB adapter: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10.
' services/course-service/.env:2 selects course_db; credentials are omitted.
' Post-save refresh: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.builder.lesson.add.tsx:77-83;
' frontend/src/components/layout/layout.instructor.course.tsx:35-58.
' Refresh: course.service.ts:55; courses.controller.ts:73; courses.service.ts:195;
' courses.repository.ts:108 (all under the frontend/services or Course module paths above).

actor Instructor
boundary "Add Lesson Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' Preconditions: authenticated Instructor, loaded Course Builder context and selected Module.
' Entry: /instructor/courses/{courseId}/builder/modules/{moduleId}/lessons/new.
' If Module is absent from loaded structure.modules, the page displays "Module not found."
' instead of the form and sends no POST. Missing route IDs render nothing.
' Initial tree loading is preparation, not another UC15 flow in this diagram.
' JWT/internal-key middleware and token-refresh mechanics are outside the main interaction.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open Add Lesson for selected Module
activate Screen
Instructor -> Screen: Enter title and content; select Add Lesson
Screen -> Screen: Check required fields and editability
activate Screen
deactivate Screen

' handleSave trims both fields, ignores duplicate saves and rejects structureLocked.
' UI limits: title 200 characters, introductory content 20000 characters.
' structureLocked is lockedAt != null OR status == Submitted, from loaded builder context.
alt Form checked successfully
  Screen -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/modules/{moduleId}/lessons\nTitle and content
  activate Gateway
  Gateway -> Controller: POST /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/modules/{moduleId}/lessons\nTrusted user context
  activate Controller
  Controller -> Service: Create Lesson
  activate Service
  Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and organization
  activate Service
  deactivate Service

  ' Outcome-level alternative: expand the successful operation, summarize rejected attempts.
  ' Rejections stop at their actual checks; successful reads/writes are not assumed on failure.
  alt Lesson created successfully
    Service -> Repository: Find Course by tenant and owner
    activate Repository
    ' where: Course.id, Course.organizationId and Course.chain.instructorId == user.userId.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read owned Course and edit status
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Course, status and lockedAt
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Owned Course
    deactivate Repository
    Service -> Service: Check Course is not Submitted or Locked
    activate Service
    deactivate Service

    Service -> Repository: Find Module in Course and organization
    activate Repository
    ' findModule matches moduleId, courseId AND organizationId; it returns only the Module ID.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read matching Module
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Module ID
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Valid Module
    deactivate Repository

    Service -> Repository: Create Lesson at end of Module
    activate Repository
    ' One Prisma $transaction reads the last Lesson position descending, then inserts Lesson.
    ' Both operations use moduleId and organizationId; position = (last?.position ?? 0) + 1.
    ' Title and introductory content are stored directly on Lesson, not as a Material.
    Repository -> CourseDB: Insert Lesson at next position\nSingle transaction
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Saved Lesson
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Saved Lesson
    deactivate Repository
    Service -->> Controller: Created Lesson
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 201 Created\nLesson details
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Created Lesson
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Lesson created."

    ' handleSave always awaits refetchStructure; retain the supporting REST result refresh.
    ' This does not open Lesson content, add learning materials, or expand the full UC15.
    ' Only a successful refresh is expanded; its independent error behavior is recorded below.
    Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}/structure\nTrusted user context
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: Refresh Course structure
    activate Service
    ' getStructure checks Instructor/organization again; findStructure scopes Course ownership.
    Service -> Repository: Load owned Course structure
    activate Repository
    Repository -> CourseDB: Read Course structure\nCurrent tenant and owner
    activate CourseDB
    CourseDB -->> Repository: Course structure
    deactivate CourseDB
    Repository -->> Service: Course structure
    deactivate Repository
    Service -->> Controller: Updated structure and lock state
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nUpdated structure
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Updated structure
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -> Screen: Return to Course Builder
    activate Screen
    deactivate Screen
  else Course editing failed\nLocked or Submitted
    ' Restore executions closed in the preceding operand for PlantUML source-order rendering.
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' A matching findOwnedCourseForEditing read precedes this rejection; its repetition is omitted.
    ' Submitted is checked first, then lockedAt. Neither rejection queries Module or inserts Lesson.
    Service -->> Controller: Course editing rejected (400)
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 400 Bad Request
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Creation error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Unable to create Lesson."
  else Course or Module access failed
    activate Gateway
    activate Controller
    activate Service
    ' Non-INSTRUCTOR or missing organizationId -> 403 before the ownership query.
    ' Missing Course, wrong organization or wrong chain owner -> 404 from the scoped Course read.
    ' After an editable Course is found, Module not matching id/courseId/organizationId -> 404.
    ' Failed read attempts are summarized; no createLesson or successful write is implied.
    Service -->> Controller: Access or lookup rejected\n403 / 404
    deactivate Service
    Controller -->> Gateway: 403 Forbidden or 404 Not Found
    deactivate Controller
    Gateway -->> Screen: Creation error
    deactivate Gateway
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Unable to create Lesson."
  end
else Form check failed
  ' Empty title/content or cached structureLocked prevents POST; saving=true ignores re-entry.
  ' Locked/Submitted and empty required fields also disable the Add Lesson button.
  Screen -->> Instructor: Keep form disabled or show validation error
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' BR-79: Course ownership is scoped by chain.instructorId; organizationId provides tenant scope.
' BR-80/88: persisted lockedAt blocks adding Lesson; this UC does not query enrollments.
' Setting Locked on first Enrollment is outside this trace and has not been verified here.
' BR-284: Published and unlocked remains editable; there is no Draft-only guard.
' BR-285: Submitted blocks creation independently of lockedAt.
' BR-147: Lesson has no stored required flag. getStructure derives required from materials.some.
' A newly created empty Lesson is therefore not required; no Material/completion state is created.
' DB: lessons.module_id references modules.id with onDelete Cascade; @@unique([moduleId, position]).
' Tenant/Course membership is checked in service lookups; the FK is not tenant-composite.
' Guard limitation: ownership/status/lockedAt and Module validation precede the create transaction;
' there is no in-transaction guard recheck or explicit row lock in these methods.
' Concurrent appends can hit the unique position constraint; no retry is implemented here.
' Backend trims and rejects empty title/content; DTO content lacks IsNotEmpty but service enforces it.
' Detailed DTO, transport and persistence errors are omitted as separate branches; UI reports failure.
' HttpExceptionFilter returns error instead of top-level message, so server business rejections
' reach handleSave without response.message and display its "Unable to create Lesson." fallback.
' A failed create transaction rolls back its write; a failed refresh does not undo a saved Lesson.
' loadStructure catches refresh errors, clears structure and records an error, then resolves;
' handleSave still navigates to Builder, whose parent may display a load error instead of the tree.
' TenantClient/LearningClient/storage are injected but not called by createLesson or getStructure.
' No cross-service REST, storage provider, presigned URL, Kafka or intermediary Client lifeline.
' Parent-layout Assignment reads on route changes are unrelated to this UC and omitted.
' No Module creation, structure editing/reorder, Lesson content viewing/editing or Material upload.
@enduml
